{"4283410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eclipstation", "steam_appid": 4283410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself aboard a space station that has lost contact with the outside world. The crew has vanished, automated systems function erratically, and many sectors are sealed off. The station is still operational, but its behavior grows increasingly unpredictable. Something unknown has breached the station and continues to spread within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/c3299a01fe4b1aa5c5cef2a2c5dc2837.poster.avif?t=1776894759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/c3299a01fe4b1aa5c5cef2a2c5dc2837.webm?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/c3299a01fe4b1aa5c5cef2a2c5dc2837.mp4?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror and Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The space station no longer feels like a safe place. Silence presses in, familiar spaces appear distorted, and rare sounds force you to stop and listen. Danger is present even when it cannot be seen — and this constant tension follows you throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/7d2708daa1a57923248b9d24d7d3b9a5.poster.avif?t=1776894759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/7d2708daa1a57923248b9d24d7d3b9a5.webm?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/7d2708daa1a57923248b9d24d7d3b9a5.mp4?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely through large station levels, explore rooms, and navigate connections between sectors. Wander, encounter threats, flee when necessary, and discover new routes. Lighting affects orientation and spatial awareness: in darkness, it becomes harder to judge distance, notice movement, or understand what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/6b4caae2a7d0f31d4861d6a648a14df4.poster.avif?t=1776894759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/6b4caae2a7d0f31d4861d6a648a14df4.webm?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/6b4caae2a7d0f31d4861d6a648a14df4.mp4?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various creatures inhabit the station. Some appear suddenly, while others linger nearby for long periods, forcing changes in route or pace. Danger rarely reveals itself directly — often you sense a threat before you see it. Poor decisions can escalate tension and lead to unpredictable consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/9c5aa436e8555f7825fc2ec87fc0d287.poster.avif?t=1776894759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/9c5aa436e8555f7825fc2ec87fc0d287.webm?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/9c5aa436e8555f7825fc2ec87fc0d287.mp4?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting and Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create items by combining two components. The outcome depends on the chosen combination and is not always obvious in advance. Some items help deal with threats or environmental effects, while others may have side effects or even harmful consequences. Crafting is only available in specific areas of the station, making preparation and resource management a key part of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/5f85d461d67800963e94a5de68b0d5e1.poster.avif?t=1776894759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/5f85d461d67800963e94a5de68b0d5e1.webm?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/5f85d461d67800963e94a5de68b0d5e1.mp4?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Effects and States</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment and its inhabitants affect the character’s condition. Temporary effects can alter controls, distort visuals, or change spatial perception. Not all effects can be removed immediately — sometimes you must keep moving, adapting to altered conditions and making decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/baa5bdedf4dc4fa5b5a8e92c6406823b.poster.avif?t=1776894759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/baa5bdedf4dc4fa5b5a8e92c6406823b.webm?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/baa5bdedf4dc4fa5b5a8e92c6406823b.mp4?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture deeper, you begin to piece together what happened on the station. Each new sector brings you closer to understanding the situation, while simultaneously increasing the risk. The space grows more dangerous, the margin for error shrinks, and the station continues to operate by its own increasingly distorted rules.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself aboard a space station that has lost contact with the outside world. The crew has vanished, automated systems function erratically, and many sectors are sealed off. The station is still operational, but its behavior grows increasingly unpredictable. Something unknown has breached the station and continues to spread within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/c3299a01fe4b1aa5c5cef2a2c5dc2837.poster.avif?t=1776894759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/c3299a01fe4b1aa5c5cef2a2c5dc2837.webm?t=1776894759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283410/extras/c3299a01fe4b1aa5c5cef